meta {
  name: teacher time off
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/administrator/teachers/:id/time-off/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a
}

body:json {
  {
    // Start of the blackout window. Required, ISO-8601 with offset.
    "start_datetime": "2026-12-24T00:00:00-05:00",

    // End of the window. Required, and must be after start_datetime.
    "end_datetime": "2027-01-02T00:00:00-05:00",

    // Optional label, shown in the admin list.
    "reason": "Christmas holidays"
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Holidays and blackout windows, which override the teacher's weekly
  availability. Any slot overlapping one of these disappears from
  `GET /public/teachers/<id>/slots/` and is refused at booking time.

  This does not cancel classes that are already booked inside the window -- move
  or cancel those from the sessions list.

  `GET` on the same URL lists that teacher's entries.
  `GET`/`PUT`/`PATCH`/`DELETE /administrator/time-off/<id>/` handle one entry.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "time_off": {
      "id": "c4e8a1b7-2d95-4f30-8a16-9b7c3e5d2f48",
      "teacher": "1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a",
      "start_datetime": "2026-12-24T00:00:00-05:00",
      "end_datetime": "2027-01-02T00:00:00-05:00",
      "reason": "Christmas holidays",
      "created_at": "2026-09-05T09:20:00.000000-05:00"
    }
  }
}
